<title>HONG KONG: Tak Wing Inv 1996 net down 42 percent.</title>
<headline>Tak Wing Inv 1996 net down 42 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   11.5   vs  19.9</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.0    vs  6.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    26.42  vs  45.29</p>
<p>    Turnover		     695.11 vs  1,227.15</p>
<p>    Company name		 Tak Wing Investment (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 19-25</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   July 31</p>
<p>NOTE - Tak Wing is a construction and civil engineering group.</p>
<p>The company proposed a bonus issue of one 1998 warrant for every five shares held.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is six H.K. cents (including interim dividend of three cents) vs nine cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
